{
  "mukhattat": 1,
  "isdar": "1.0.0",
  "wasf": "The fonts Taarib ships. Every entry is validated against the Arabic OpenType requirement in Decision 6 before it is allowed to shape a single string. A family's sifat lists only the tags taarib-saff's shaping plan actually drives (SIFAT_WASL_KAMILA in wasl.rs, plus clig), and only those every face of that family declares: a face-count of one is what a font picker can promise, and a tag no shaper asks for tells a reader nothing. The values were read out of the pinned files, not copied from an upstream feature list.",
  "sifat_matluba": ["init", "medi", "fina", "rlig", "mark"],
  "nitaqat_matluba": ["U+0600-06FF", "U+0750-077F", "U+FE70-FEFF"],
  "khutut": [
    {
