      "malaf_rukhsa": "latin/IBMPlex-OFL.txt",
      "masdar": "https://github.com/IBM/plex",
      "isdar_khatt": "3.005",
      "sabab": "The Latin companion of the interface Arabic. Shares metrics, weight axis and design language, which is what keeps a bilingual interface from looking assembled from two products."
